#!/bin/sh
# repo-contract full pre-push gate: the same self-assurance suite CI runs (`npm run contract`).
# It runs every check, mutation testing included, so it takes many minutes. Fix what it reports
# instead of skipping it; CI enforces the same suite on the PR.
# See CONTRIBUTING.md and specs/decisions/0009-conventional-commits-versioning-and-local-gates.md.
#
# `npm run contract` includes the `coderabbitai` check (see
# specs/decisions/0014-coderabbit-as-a-surfaced-check.md). It runs the local
# `coderabbit review --agent` pass that this hook once ran as a separate step. When the CLI is not
# installed, the check's policy reports a `warn`, so the skip stays visible.
set -eu
npm run contract
